Source modules: src/store/kbsync/*.hpp, src/store/data/{arithmetic,codecs,
keys,packet,prehash,prehash_maps,record}.hpp and src/data_mask.hpp.

The Go standard library supplies AES, CBC, MD5, SHA-1, HMAC, random input,
constant-time MAC comparison and serialization. The recovered prehash tables
and arithmetic remain source-derived and hash-pinned; no Apple executable,
interpreter, JIT, native library, HTTP client or account state is included.

Tests use invented DSIDs/hardware and public deterministic arithmetic only.
Compatibility evidence is offline. No Apple account or server acceptance claim.
